usage: report-landing-audit.py [-h] [--lane-repo LANE_REPO]
                               [--fleet-repo FLEET_REPO] [--branch BRANCH]
                               [--lane LANE] [--rounds ROUNDS]
                               [--report REPORT] [--errata ERRATA]
                               [--no-errata] [--json] [--selftest]

Audit kama round reports for unresolvable commit citations and landed-commit
omissions.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --lane-repo LANE_REPO
  --fleet-repo FLEET_REPO
  --branch BRANCH
  --lane LANE
  --rounds ROUNDS
  --report REPORT       N=PATH: audit a draft report for round N
  --errata ERRATA
  --no-errata
  --json
  --selftest
